# Photos sources des maquettes produit : lourdes (7 Mo) et inutiles en prod.
# Les versions servies sont dans frontend/src/assets/products/*.avif.
sources/

# The built frontend. CI runs `npm run build` before it rsyncs PythonDCA/, so what is
# committed here is never what gets deployed — it was 34 tracked files that changed on
# every local build, dirtied the tree, and had to be checked out again before every
# commit. Deleting a stale one from the index cannot break the deploy: the build that
# ships regenerates the whole directory.
# Everything in it, not just the bundles: the icons and the 4.4 MB segmentation model
# are copies of frontend/public/, which Vite puts there on every build. Tracking both
# copies stored the weights twice in the repository.
PythonDCA/dist/
